er)` - cap all tickets for this type. |","table":"table-1"},"240":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-48","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#advanced-roles-limits-welcome-override","content":"| Field                    | Meaning                            |\n| ------------------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| `Welcome title override` | Overrides the welcome embed title. |","table":"table-1"},"241":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-49","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#advanced-roles-limits-welcome-override","content":"| Field                           | Meaning                             |\n| ------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `Welcome colour override (hex)` | Overrides the welcome embed colour. |","table":"table-1"},"242":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-50","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#advanced-roles-limits-welcome-override","content":"| Field                      | Meaning                              |\n| -------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `Welcome message override` | Overrides the welcome embed message. |","table":"table-1"},"243":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-51","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#advanced-roles-limits-welcome-override","content":"| Field                                                                | Meaning    |\n| -------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------- |\n| `Sub-types (one per line: emoji label \\| description; blank = none)` | See below. |","table":"table-1"},"244":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-52","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#sub-types","content":"A sub-type is a second choice under a ticket type - e.g. type `Bug report` with sub-types\n`