n` | Body text on the panel embed. |"],[220,"| Label       | Meaning                         |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `Image URL` | Large image on the panel embed. |"],[219,"| Label    | Meaning                                      |\n| -------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `Footer` | Small text at the bottom of the panel embed. |"],[210,"| Label   | Meaning                     |\n| ------- | --------------------------- |\n| `Title` | Heading on the panel embed. |"],[171,"| Page                 | URL         |\n| -------------------- | ----------- |\n| Agent prompt (short) | `/llms.txt` |"],[172,"| Page                | URL              |\n| ------------------- | ---------------- |\n| Agent prompt (full) | `/llms-full.txt` |"],[168,"| Page             | URL           |\n| ---------------- | ------------- |\n| Terms of Service | `/terms.html` |"],[169,"| Page           | URL             |\n| -------------- | --------------- |\n| Privacy Policy | `/privacy.html` |"],[170,"| Page        | URL            |\n| ----------- | -------------- |\n| Live status | `/status.html` |"],[594,"| Permission                   | Why the bot wants it        |\n| ---------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **Send Messages in Threads** | Post inside thread tickets. |"],[593,"| Permission                 | Why the bot wants it         |\n| -------------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| **Create Private Threads** | Open private thread tickets. |"],[587,"| Permission               | Why the bot wants it                   |\n| ------------------------ | -------------------------------------- |\n| **Read Message History** | Read a ticket to build its transcript. |"],[591,"| Permission              | Why the bot wants it                     |\n| ----------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **Use External Emojis** | Use custom emoji in panels and messages. |"],[588,"| Permission  