les, blacklists, transcripts, stats and the audit log. |"],[564,"| Place       | What for                                                                                       |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Discord** | Where users open tickets from a panel and staff claim, rename, tag, prioritise and close them. |"],[313,"| Row                                                  | Meaning                             |\n| ---------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `Database (D1)` / `Ticket storage and configuration` | A chip `operational` or `degraded`. |"],[312,"| Row                                   | Meaning                                         |\n| ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `Service` / `dat one ticketer worker` | A chip `operational` (green) or `down` (amber). |"],[423,"| Style      | UI              | Max types |\n| ---------- | --------------- | --------- |\n| `Dropdown` | One select menu | 25        |"],[13,"| Style     | Discord number | Look |\n| --------- | -------------- | ---- |\n| Secondary | 2              | Grey |"],[424,"| Style     | UI                  | Max types |\n| --------- | ------------------- | --------- |\n| `Buttons` | One button per type | 5         |"],[12,"| Style   | Discord number | Look    |\n| ------- | -------------- | ------- |\n| Primary | 1              | Blurple |"],[14,"| Style   | Discord number | Look  |\n| ------- | -------------- | ----- |\n| Success | 3              | Green |"],[15,"| Style  | Discord number | Look |\n| ------ | -------------- | ---- |\n| Danger | 4              | Red  |"],[369,"| Subcommand                 | Does                                           |\n| -------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `staff-role action: role:` | Add (`add`) or remove (`remove`) a staff role. |"],[378,"| Subcommand          | Does                                |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `add user: reason:` | Blocks a user from opening tickets. |"],[368,"| Subcommand        | Does                                     |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `set key: value:` | Update one setting - see the keys below. |"],[365,"| Subcommand     | Does                   |\n| -------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `remove user:` | Remove a user (staff). |"],[379,"| Subcommand     | Does             |\n| -------------- | ---------------- |\n| `remove user:` | Unblocks a user. |"],[364,"| Subcommand  | Does                |\n| ----------- | ------------------- |\n| `add user:` | Add a user (staff). |"],[353,"| Subcommand | Arguments                                                                                                            | Does                                                                  |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `create`   | `channel` (required), `name` (required), `title`, `description`, `mode` (Channel/Thread), `style` (Dropdown/Buttons) | Creates a panel and posts it. Starts with one `General Support` type. |"],[356,"| Subcommand | Arguments              | Does                                  |\n| ---------- | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `resend`   | `panel` (autocomplete) | Re-posts an existing panel's message. |"],[355,"| Subcommand | Arguments              | Does                             |\n| ---------- | ---------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `delete`   | `panel` (autocomplete) | Deletes a panel and its message. |"],[354,"| Subcommand | Arguments | Does                                      