ys the sign-in expired, the Discord token lapsed; re-authorise. |"],[629,"| Symptom                                        | Fix                                |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `You need the **Manage Server** permission...` | Same - the command is staff-gated. |"],[622,"| Symptom                                      | Fix                                                                           |\n| -------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Nothing happens when a user clicks the panel | Make sure the bot was invited with the permissions it asks for (Permissions). |"],[637,"| Symptom                                      | Fix                                                                    |\n| -------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| The bot's messages are in the wrong language | Pick the language again, review the text, and press **Save settings**. |"],[616,"| Symptom                                      | Fix                                                                 |\n| -------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Bot is not in this server` in the dashboard | Click **Add to Server** on that server's page and let the bot join. |"],[625,"| Symptom                                     | Fix                                                                                                                      |\n| ------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `Sorry, I couldn't create your ticket: ...` | Usually a missing category or a permission problem in the ticket category. Check the category and the bot's permissions.