 ---------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| My colour change did nothing | Check the **panel** and **ticket type** overrides - they beat the server setting. |"],[634,"| Symptom                    | Fix                                                                                                            |\n| -------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Internal notes are missing | That's by design - notes are never in transcripts. They're posted to the log channel and stored on the ticket. |"],[618,"| Symptom                    | Fix                                                           |\n| -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| A panel shows `not posted` | Open it and press **Save changes** to post it to the channel. |"],[626,"| Symptom                | Fix                                                                                                                    |\n| ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Panel shows no options | The panel has no ticket types, or you used **Buttons** style with more than 5 types. Use **Dropdown** for more than 5. |"],[628,"| Symptom             | Fix                                                                                  |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `Only staff can...` | You need **Manage Channels**, or a role listed in **Staff roles** / **Admin roles**. |"],[621,"| Symptom          | Fix                                                                                 |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| The theme resets | The choice is stored per-browser; a different browser or a cleared cache resets it. |"],[187,"| Tab         | Page        | Purpose                                   |\n| ----------- | ----------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| Transcripts | Transcripts | Search and open saved ticket transcripts. |"],[189,"| Tab       | Page      | Purpose                                |\n| --------- | --------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| Audit log | Audit log | Reverse-chronological list of changes. |"],[186,"| Tab      | Page           | Purpose                        |\n| -------- | -------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| Settings | `#/guild/<id>` | Everything in the table above. |"],[188,"| Tab   | Page  | Purpose                                     |\n| ----- | ----- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| Stats | Stats | Totals and per-staff claimed/closed counts. |"],[122,"| Token              | Becomes                                  |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `{claimerMention}` | A mention of whoever claimed the ticket. |"],[123,"| Token             | Becomes                                 |\n| ----------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `{closerMention}` | A mention of whoever closed the ticket. |"],[121,"| Token             | Becomes                         |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `{openerMention}` | A mention of the ticket opener. |"],[114,"| Token          | Becomes                  |\n| -------------- | ------------------------ |\n| `{userAvatar}` | The opener's avatar URL. |"],[113,"| Token        | Becomes                        |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------ |\n| `{username}` | The opener's Discord username. |"],[278,"| Token        | Becomes                       |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------- |\n| `{username}` | the opener's Discord username |"],[1